@startuml
title Sơ đồ Tuần tự: Use-case Đặt và Thanh toán Đơn hàng (Sequence Diagram)
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer\n(Khách hàng)" as Customer
box "Frontend Client" #EBF8FF
participant "Next.js UI\n(PWA)" as UI
end box

box "Backend Services" #E6FFFA
participant "NestJS API\n(OrderController)" as API
participant "OrderService" as Service
end box

box "Data Persistence" #EDF2F7
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
end box

box "Third-party" #FED7D7
participant "Payment Service\n(Mock Gateway)" as Payment
end box

Customer -> UI: Bấm "Xác nhận đặt hàng & Thanh toán"
activate UI
UI -> UI: Generate UUIDv4 for Idempotency-Key
UI -> API: POST /api/orders/checkout\nHeaders: [Authorization: Bearer <JWT>, Idempotency-Key: <UUID>]\nBody: { items, paymentMethod: 'E_WALLET', deliveryNote }
activate API

API -> API: JwtAuthGuard: Verify Bearer Token & Extract userId
API -> API: ValidationPipe: Validate CreateOrderDto format

API -> Service: checkout(userId, dto, idempotencyKey)
activate Service

Service -> DB: Check IdempotencyKey in Cache/DB
activate DB
DB --> Service: Key status: NOT_FOUND (Request mới)
deactivate DB

note over Service, DB: Bắt đầu Database Transaction: prisma.$transaction(async (tx) => ...)
Service -> DB: tx.product.findMany({ where: { id: in [itemIds] } })
activate DB
DB --> Service: Danh sách sản phẩm & tồn kho
deactivate DB

alt Trường hợp: Sản phẩm hết hàng (Stock <= 0)
  Service --> API: Throw BadRequestException('Sản phẩm đã hết hàng')
  API --> UI: HTTP 400 Bad Request { message: 'Out of stock' }
  UI --> Customer: Hiển thị cảnh báo hết hàng & cập nhật giỏ
else Sản phẩm đủ tồn kho
  Service -> DB: tx.order.create({ data: { code, userId, status: 'PENDING', totalAmount } })
  activate DB
  DB --> Service: Order created (id: 'ord_123')
  deactivate DB

  Service -> DB: tx.orderItem.createMany({ items with price snapshot })
  activate DB
  DB --> Service: OrderItems created
  deactivate DB

  Service -> Payment: processPayment({ orderId: 'ord_123', amount, method: 'E_WALLET', idempotencyKey })
  activate Payment

  alt Nhánh thanh toán THẤT BẠI (Số dư không đủ / Thẻ lỗi)
    Payment --> Service: { success: false, errorCode: 'INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS' }
    Service -> DB: tx.order.update({ status: 'PAYMENT_FAILED' })
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Order status updated
    deactivate DB
    Service --> API: Throw PaymentRequiredException('Thanh toán thất bại')
    API --> UI: HTTP 402 Payment Required { errorCode: 'INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS' }
    UI --> Customer: Báo lỗi thanh toán & cho phép chọn phương thức khác
  else Nhánh thanh toán THÀNH CÔNG
    Payment --> Service: { success: true, transactionRef: 'TX_998877', paidAt: ISO }
    deactivate Payment

    Service -> DB: tx.payment.create({ data: { orderId, transactionRef, status: 'SUCCESS' } })
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Payment record saved
    deactivate DB

    Service -> DB: tx.order.update({ where: { id }, data: { status: 'PAID' } })
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Order status updated to PAID
    deactivate DB

    loop Từng sản phẩm trong đơn hàng
      Service -> DB: tx.product.update({ decrement: quantity })
      activate DB
      DB --> Service: Tồn kho đã trừ
      deactivate DB
    end
    note over Service, DB: Commit Database Transaction thành công
  end
end

Service --> API: Return { orderId, code: 'BL-2026', status: 'PAID', totalAmount }
deactivate Service

API --> UI: HTTP 201 Created { success: true, data: OrderSummary }
deactivate API

UI -> UI: Clear Cart in LocalStorage/State
UI --> Customer: Điều hướng sang /orders/BL-2026 & Hiển thị thông báo thành công
deactivate UI
@enduml
